          "transliteration": "tasya haitasya sāmno yaḥ svaṃ veda bhavati hāsya svam | tasya vai svara eva svam | tasmādārtvijyaṃ kariṣyanvāci svaramiccheta tayā vācā svarasampannayā''rtvijyaṃ kuryāt tasmādyajñe svaravantaṃ didṛkṣanta evātho yasya svaṃ bhavati | bhavati hāsya svaṃ ya evametatsāmnaḥ svaṃ veda ||",
